# T4 · T-138 명령 팔레트(10-05 §76): view.palette = 열림 → 글자 입력 = 결과 좁힘 → Enter = 명령 실행(선택 반전 → 전부 선택) → 닫힘 · Esc 닫힘.
id: palette
title: 명령 팔레트 열기 · 검색 · Enter 실행 · Esc
tree: file a.txt 3
tree: file b.txt 4
settings: ui.lang=en
cmd: @ready:view.palette
cmd: @ready:palette.dump:<out>/open.txt
cmd: @ready:ui.type:invert sel
cmd: @ready:palette.dump:<out>/typed.txt
cmd: @ready:ui.press:enter
cmd: @ready:palette.dump:<out>/after.txt
cmd: @ready:panel.dump:<out>/panel.txt
cmd: @ready:view.palette
cmd: @ready:ui.press:escape
cmd: @ready:palette.dump:<out>/esc.txt
cmd: @ready:quit
check: open.txt: open true
check: open.txt: query 
check: open.txt: view.refresh
check: typed.txt: query invert sel
check: typed.txt: edit.select_invert
check: after.txt: open false
check: panel.txt: rows 2 selected 2
check: esc.txt: open false
